note dq8_@B@: q8_0 dot over @B@ blocks of 34 bytes (f16 scale d, 32 signed bytes q) against f32 x:
note acc (f64 bits) + sum over blocks of f64(d * sum_j f32(q_j)*x_j); fin 1 returns the f32 total.
fn q8s u uchar to f32
q = long u
if ge q 128
q = sub q 256
end
ret f32 q
end
fn q8d w view uchar @W@ o ulong to f32
ret h2f ushort or ulong get w o shl ulong get w add o 1 8
end
fn dq8_@B@ acc ulong w view uchar @W@ x view f32 @X@ fin ulong to ulong
s = bitcast f64 acc
for b ulong @B@
o = mul b 34
xo = mul b 32
bs = f32 0.0
for j ulong 32
bs = add bs mul q8s get w add add o 2 j get x add xo j
end
s = add s f64 mul q8d view w o bs
end
if eq fin 1
ret ulong bitcast uint f32 s
end
ret bitcast ulong s
end
